        "sid": "JHN 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ciise iyo Naagtii Reer Samaariya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolkii Ciise ogaaday inay Farrisiintu maqleen inuu yeelanayay oo baabtiisayay xer ka badan intii Yooxanaa ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(in kastoo Ciise qudhiisu uusan baabtiisin, laakiin xertiisu way baabtiisayeen), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ayuu Yuhuudiya ka tegey, wuxuuna mar kale u kacay Galili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wuxuu lahaa inuu Samaariya dhex maro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba wuxuu yimid magaalada Samaariya, oo Sukhar la odhan jiray, oo ku dhowayd dalkii Yacquub siiyey wiilkiisii Yuusuf. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaana meeshaas jiray ceelkii Yacquub. Haddaba Ciise oo sodcaal ku soo daalay, wuxuu fadhiistay ceelka agtiisa. Saacaddiina waxay ku qiyaasnayd lixda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa waxaa timid naag reer Samaariya ah inay biyo dhaansato. Kolkaasaa Ciise wuxuu ku yidhi iyada, I waraabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maxaa yeelay, xertiisii magaaladay ku maqnaayeen inay cunto soo iibsadaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagtii reer Samaariya ahayd waxay haddaba ku tidhi isaga, Sidee baad, adigoo Yuhuudi ah, biyo ii weyddiisanaysaa, anigoo naag reer Samaariya ah? (Waayo, dan iskuma leh Yuhuudda iyo reer Samaariya.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ciise waa u jawaabay oo ku yidhi iyada, Haddaad garanaysid hadiyaddii Ilaah iyo kuu yahay kan kugu leh, I waraabi, adigu waad weyddiisan lahayd isaga, oo wuxuu ku siin lahaa biyaha nool. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagtii waxay ku tidhi, Sayidow, waxaad biyo ku dhaansato ma haysatid, ceelkuna wuu dheer yahay. Haddaba xaggee baad ka helaysaa biyaha nool? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Miyaad ka weyn tahay awowahayagii Yacquub oo ceelka na siiyey oo isaga qudhiisu ka cabbay iyo wiilashiisii iyo xoolihiisuba? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ciise ayaa u jawaabay oo ku yidhi iyada, Kii kasta oo biyahan ka cabbaa, mar kale wuu harraadi doonaa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "laakiin ku alla kii ka cabba biyahaan siin doono, weligiis ma harraadi doono, laakiin biyahaan siin doono waxay gudihiisa ku noqon doonaan il biyo ka duulayaan tan iyo nolosha weligeed ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagtii waxay ku tidhi, Sayidow, biyahan i sii inaanan haddana harraadin oo aanan halkan iman inaan ka dhaansado. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Ciise wuxuu ku yidhi, Tag oo ninkaagii u soo yeedh, oo halkan kaalay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagtii ayaa u jawaabtay oo ku tidhi, Nin ma lihi. Ciise wuxuu ku yidhi, Run baad ku hadashay, Nin ma lihi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, shan nin baad lahayd, kan aad haddeer haysatidna ninkaagii ma aha. Taas run baad ku sheegtay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagtii waxay ku tidhi, Sayidow, waan gartay inaad nebi tahay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awowayaashayo buurtan ayay ku caabudi jireen, idinkuse waxaad tidhaahdaan, Yeruusaalem waa meeshii la leeyahay in lagu caabudo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Ciise wuxuu ku yidhi, Naag yahay, i rumee, saacaddu waa imanaysaa markii aydnaan Aabbaha ku caabudi doonin ama buurtan ama Yeruusaalem midnaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Idinku waxaad caabuddaan waxaydnaan oqoon, annaguse waxaannu caabudnaa waxaannu naqaan, waayo, badbaadintu waxay ka timaadaa Yuhuudda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiin saacaddii baa imanaysa, waana joogtaa imminkada, markii caabudayaasha runta ihi ay Aabbaha ku caabudi doonaan ruuxa iyo runta, waayo, Aabbuhu wuxuu doonayaa caabudayaashaas oo kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaah waa Ruux, kuwa caabudaa isagana waa inay ku caabudaan ruuxa iyo runta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagtii waxay ku tidhi, Waa ogahay Masiixu inuu imanayo (kan Kiristoos la yidhaahdo); oo markuu yimaado, wax walba ayuu noo sheegi doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Ciise wuxuu ku yidhi, Anigoo kula hadlaya ayaa ah isaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isla markii waxaa timid xertiisii, wayna la yaabeen markay arkeen inuu naag la hadlayo. Weliba ninna ma odhan, Maxaad doonaysaa? Amase, Maxaad ula hadlaysaa iyada? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaa aawadeed naagtii ayaa ashuunkeedii ka tagtay, oo magaaladay u baxday, oo waxay ku tidhi dadkii, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaalaya oo arka ninkii ii sheegay wax walba oo aan sameeyey. Miyaanu kani ahayn Masiixa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasay magaaladii ka soo baxeen, wayna u imanayeen isagii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolkaasay xertiisii baryeen iyagoo leh, Macallimow, wax cun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiin wuxuu iyagii ku yidhi, Anigu waxaan haystaa cunto aan cuno oo aydnaan ogayn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba xertiisii waxay isku yidhaahdeen, Ma loo keenay wuxuu cuno? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ciise wuxuu ku yidhi, Cuntadaydu waa inaan sameeyo doonistii kii i soo diray oo aan shuqulkiisa dhammeeyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Miyaydnaan odhanin, Waxaa weli hadhay afar bilood oo markaas ayaa beerta la gooynayaa? Bal eega, waxaan idin leeyahay, Indhihiinna kor u qaada oo daya beeraha inay u cad yihiin beergooyska. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kii gooyaa mushahaaruu helaa, wuxuuna midho u ururiyaa nolosha weligeed ah, inay kii beera iyo kii gooyaaba isla farxaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hadalku waa ku run kan, Mid baa beera, mid kalena waa gooyaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaan idiin diray inaad gooysaan wixii aydnaan ku hawshoon. Kuwa kale baa hawshooday, hawshoodiina waad gasheen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaa magaaladaas ka rumaystay isaga dad badan oo reer Samaariya ah, hadalkii naagta aawadiis, markay marag furtay oo tidhi, Wuxuu ii sheegay wax walba oo aan sameeyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaa darteed markii dadka reer Samaariya ah u yimaadeen isaga, way baryeen inuu la joogo, wuxuuna halkaas joogay laba maalmood. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa kuwo kale oo badani rumaysteen hadalkiisii aawadiis, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo waxay naagtii ku yidhaahdeen, Imminka waxaannu u rumaysanaynaa ma aha hadalkaaga aawadiis, maxaa yeelay, qudhayadu waannu maqalnay, waannuna naqaan kanu inuu runtii yahay Badbaadiyaha dunida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ciise wuxuu Bogsiiyey Sirkaalkii Wiilkiisii",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labadaas maalmood dabadeed meeshaas ayuu ka tegey oo Galili aaday. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Ciise ayaa ka marag kacay inaan nebi waddankiis murwad ku lahayn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba markuu Galili yimid, dadkii Galili way soo dhoweeyeen, iyagoo arkay wuxuu ku sameeyey Yeruusaalem oo dhan wakhtigii iidda, waayo, iyaguna iiddii way tageen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba mar kale ayuu yimid Kaana tii Galili oo ahayd meeshuu biyihii khamriga kaga dhigay. Meeshaasna waxaa joogay sirkaal wiilkiisii ku bukay Kafarna'um. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isagu markuu maqlay inuu Ciise Yahuudiya ka yimid oo Galili gaadhay, ayuu u tegey oo ka baryay inuu u yimaado oo wiilkiisa bogsiiyo, waayo, dhimashuu u dhowaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba Ciise wuxuu ku yidhi, Haddaanad calaamooyin iyo yaabab arkin, marnaba ma rumaysan doontaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sirkaalkii wuxuu ku yidhi, Sayidow, kaalay intaan wiilkaygu dhiman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ciise wuxuu ku yidhi, Soco, wiilkaagii waa nool yahay. Markaasaa ninkii rumaystay hadalkii Ciise ku yidhi, wuuna socday. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Intuu socday ayaa addoommadiisii ka hor yimaadeen, iyagoo leh, Wiilkaagii waa nool yahay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu wuxuu iyagii weyddiiyey saacadduu ladnaaday. Waxay ku yidhaahdeen, Shalayto saacaddii toddobaad ayaa qandhadii daysay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa aabbuhu gartay inay saacaddaas ahayd saacaddii Ciise ku yidhi, Wiilkaagii waa nool yahay. Markaasaa isagii qudhiisu rumaystay iyo kuwii gurigiisii joogay oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba tanu waa calaamadii labaad oo Ciise sameeyey markuu Yahuudiya ka tegey oo Galili yimid.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.54"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
